  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1986,
    "RowId": 47,
    "Text": "Your foothold in this untamed land, hastily built using materials scavenged in the wilds."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2086,
    "RowId": 48,
    "Text": "The crux of your island operation, one snuggly step above the bare necessities."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2178,
    "RowId": 49,
    "Text": "The cornerstone of your thriving island enterprise, fully renovated by mammets skilled in carpentry."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2290,
    "RowId": 50,
    "Text": "Four walls and a roof under which your bright-eyed mammets eagerly make handicrafts."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2386,
    "RowId": 51,
    "Text": "A practical-yet-modest facility at which your reliable mammets craft artisan goods."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2482,
    "RowId": 52,
    "Text": "A stately workplace designed with the professional mammet handicrafter in mind."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2574,
    "RowId": 53,
    "Text": "A basic storehouse for island materials and gathering place for exploratory mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2670,
    "RowId": 54,
    "Text": "A facility with adequate storage space and resources to support a reliable team of foraging mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2782,
    "RowId": 55,
    "Text": "An expansive and professional-grade island repository populated by elite mammet gleaners. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2886,
    "RowId": 56,
    "Text": "An empty lot brimming with architectural potential."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 2950,
    "RowId": 57,
    "Text": "Giant, spinning vanes that will not fulfill your glorious aspirations so much as they will power the mill that grinds your grain. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3118,
    "RowId": 58,
    "Text": "A secluded hideout nestled among lofty, verdant boughs. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3210,
    "RowId": 59,
    "Text": "The well-intentioned automata in charge of its temperature boast that this lovely outdoor bath will sear the impurities from your skin and leave you clean...if you survive. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3422,
    "RowId": 60,
    "Text": "Great pains were taken to construct this lighthouse in the Lominsan style despite limited materials and heated creative differences amongst its mammet architects. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3622,
    "RowId": 61,
    "Text": "Answering the age-old question─an otter <i>spouting</i> water might, in fact, be odder than an otter out of water. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3778,
    "RowId": 62,
    "Text": "Cropland"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3798,
    "RowId": 63,
    "Text": "Pasture"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3818,
    "RowId": 64,
    "Text": "Beds of rich, tilled soil perfect for the cultivation of crops."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3894,
    "RowId": 65,
    "Text": "A lush, green field accommodating to island animals of all shapes and sizes."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 3982,
    "RowId": 66,
    "Text": "Islekeep's Index"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 4010,
    "RowId": 67,
    "Text": "Gamboling Garden"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 4038,
    "RowId": 68,
    "Text": "This so-called “garden” is a playground in all but name, contrived by a group of mammets who conspire to create a secret paradise of their own, one landmark at a time. Adored by island mammets."
  },
  {
