  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 4318,
    "RowId": 72,
    "Text": "A state-of-the-art establishment specifically designed to support veteran mammet gleaners."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 4422,
    "RowId": 73,
    "Text": "Cozy Cabin IV"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 4446,
    "RowId": 74,
    "Text": "An elegant statement of success and island affluence, from prow to sturdy second floor."
  },
  {
